The total cost of 10 gallons of gas is 10 gallons * $3.00/gallon = $30.00. The cashback offered is $0.20 per gallon, so for 10 gallons, the cashback is 10 gallons * $0.20/gallon = $2.00. The final cost is the total cost minus the cashback, which is $30.00 - $2.00 = $28.00.
\boxed{28.00}

